        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gordon Burns\n- Products: The Krypton Factor\n- Organizations: ITV, BBC\n- Roles: host, chief anchorman\n- Topics: television broadcasting, regional news\n\nFacts:\n- The Krypton Factor originally ran from 7 September 1977 to 20 November 1995.\n- Gordon Burns was the host of The Krypton Factor for its original 18-year run from 1977 to 1995.\n- The Krypton Factor was usually broadcast on the ITV network on Mondays at 7pm.\n- Gordon Burns was the chief anchorman for the BBC regional news programme North West Tonight from January 1997 to October 2011.",
